Modifications in this distribution include a personal cloud host, account portal,
OAuth device enrollment, optional message gateways, a Windows/Linux executor,
remote execution protocol, shared filesystem/shell runtime, approval UI, and the
v4 core overlay with its MCP capability packages. The overlay scope and patch
list are recorded in docs/upstream/.
This is a separate distribution and is not an official upstream Peri release.

The QQ adapter was independently implemented in Rust with protocol guidance from
Prism and behavior reference from Hermes Agent (https://github.com/NousResearch/hermes-agent).
No Hermes or Prism checkout, configuration, credentials or runtime data is included.
